/*
 * ecpp_gpu_driver.cpp — CUDA Driver API host driver for ECPP kernels
 *
 * Uses the CUDA Driver API loaded dynamically at runtime via cuda_loader.h.
 * No CUDA SDK needed at build or run time — only nvcuda.dll.
 *
 * PTX kernels are embedded as string constants (generated by nvcc offline)
 * and JIT-compiled by the driver to the user's specific GPU architecture.
 *
 * Build: compiled as plain C++ (g++, clang++, MSVC) — no nvcc required.
 *
 * Copyright (c) 2026 The Freycoin developers
 * Licensed under GPL v3+
 */

